sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Anchor
    participant C as Client
    participant O as Origin
    participant M as Moderator / DAP Leader / Collector
    participant H as DAP Helper

    Note over C,M: Task fixes an ordered Anchor set and Field128 Prio3 profile<br/>Anchor at bucket b has hidden tag j = b plus 1

    C->>A: Request endorsement
    A-->>C: Endorsement

    Note over C: Choose fresh C_issue = j·H plus ρ_issue·R
    C->>M: Redeem endorsement and joint proof linking endorsed Anchor to C_issue<br/>Request credential with hidden attribute j
    M->>M: Verify redemption, same-Anchor proof, and issuance proof
    M-->>C: Issue credential authenticating hidden j

    C->>O: Request quality receipt for an authorized outcome
    O-->>C: Authenticated outcome label and policy version
    Note over C,M: Example label is good. Private histogram bucket identifies Anchor b

    Note over C: Choose fresh C_report = j·H plus ρ_report·R<br/>Encode x as one-hot at bucket b<br/>Vanilla Prio3Histogram-shard x and split ρ_report into ρ₀ plus ρ₁
    Note over C: Encrypt (VDAF share₀, ρ₀) for Moderator<br/>Encrypt (VDAF share₁, ρ₁) for Helper<br/>Hash task, report ID, nonce, label, C_report, and report shares<br/>Exclude spend proof from digest to avoid a circular dependency

    C->>M: One submission with credential presentation and spend proof,<br/>origin label receipt, C_report, nonce, public share, and both encrypted shares
    M->>M: Verify spend binds hidden j to C_report and report digest<br/>Check label, task, credential nullifier, and report ID replay
    M->>M: Decrypt share₀ and expand x₀<br/>Derive t₀ = Σ(i+1)x₀[i] mod p<br/>Prio3 verify_init and compute P₀ = t₀·H plus ρ₀·R
    M->>H: Aggregation init: Helper share, metadata, acceptance assertion,<br/>Leader verifier share and P₀
    H->>H: Verify acceptance, decrypt and expand x₁<br/>Derive t₁ = Σ(i+1)x₁[i] mod p<br/>Prio3 verify_init and compute P₁ = t₁·H plus ρ₁·R<br/>Combine verifier shares, check Prio3 and P₀ plus P₁<br/>equals C_report or C_report plus p·H
    H-->>M: New versioned aggregation response: vanilla verifier message and P₁
    M->>M: Verify Prio3 message and check P₀ plus P₁<br/>equals C_report or C_report plus p·H
    Note over M,H: One Prio3 round trip with DAP request extension and new response encoding

    Note over M,H: Only after vanilla Prio3 validity and commitment binding succeed<br/>accept the x output shares, never the locally projected t values
    M->>M: Add x₀ to aggregate for origin / label-policy / "good"
    H->>H: Add x₁ to corresponding aggregate

    H-->>M: Helper aggregate share
    M->>M: Combine with own aggregate share and recover<br/>per-Anchor counts for this origin and outcome label
